    "title": "County Property Assessor of 29 years Ronda Clanton retires - NewsBreak",
    "text": "7 hours ago During the County Commissioner meeting on Dec. 9, during the closing announcements Ronda Clanton, Bedford County’s Property Assessor, announced that she will be retiring after serving for 29 years in her role. Initially being elected in 1996, Clanton has accrued extensive experience as an assessor not only in the public sector but in the private as well. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
